      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Ground-Truth & Bootstrap",
      "items": [
        "Analyst feedback in Elasticsearch provides ground-truth block/allow labels",
        "Deterministic synthetic generator supplies 10k calibrated bootstrap samples on cold start",
        "Join between labels and events produces normalized 14-column dataset.csv"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Lightweight Interpretable Model",
      "items": [
        "Feature engineering encodes nominal vendors/detectors and ordinal severity",
        "Logistic Regression achieves sub-millisecond execution without GPU hardware",
        "Calibrated probability scores feed directly into Playbook AST decisions"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "orange",
      "title": "Zero-Downtime Hot-Reload",
      "items": [
        "Artifact bundle preserves model, feature columns, and severity mappings",
        "Daemon checks file modification timestamp (st_mtime) on every batch",
        "Instant model reload eliminates process restart during automated MLOps updates"
      ]
